BAR: global: expands afresh as >>3<<: evaluates to 3: in options
FOO: global: expands afresh as >>(1+1)<<: evaluates to 2: in options
FOO: global: expands unchanged as >>(1+1)<<: evaluates to 2
SYM: transient: expands afresh as >>(((1+1)) And ((1+1) SYM 3) And (3))<<
SYM: transient: expands unchanged as >>(((1+1)) And ((1+1) SYM 3) And (3))<<
